# Written for this pack by BurN-30 (GPL-3.0). The end-of-route dungeons: chained after Group 30,
# every chapter optional with its own question. A dungeon whose level the route never reaches near
# its door goes here, with the chains that lead into it when they could not be finished on the way.
#
# ================================================================ Blackrock Depths
# Quest ids, givers, levels, prerequisites, objectives, drops: Polestar's Forever data and its
# Dungeons codex (data-v2026.11.1); prerequisites cross-checked with the TrinityCore Forever world
# base (2026-10-14): no disagreement. Rooms, bosses and how-to: Warcraft Tavern's Forever Blackrock
# Depths dungeon and quest guides (warcrafttavern.com/forever/guides/blackrock-depths and
# .../blackrock-depths-quests, 11/11/2026), written from Classic (the dungeon was closed in the
# Forever beta), and warcraft.wiki.gg (Shadowforge Key, East Garrison, Dark Iron Legacy, Marshal
# Windsor, A Shred of Hope, Jail Break!), read on 12/11/2026. Wowhead Forever could not be read
# (robot check). Not played in game yet: places inside are to check in game.
#
# Asked once (`when group 4286`, The Good Stuff: no prerequisite, level 50); every later step needs
# `when done brd-start`. Three visits, in the order of the rooms:
#   1. no key: the Detention Block (Kharan, Windsor), the Ring of the Law, the Shrine of
#      Thaurissan, the Black Vault, the Hall of Crafting (Fineous: Ironfel), back to the Shrine's
#      monument (Dark Iron Legacy: the Shadowforge Key);
#   2. the key: the note for Windsor, the Dark Iron Highway (Bael'Gar), Shadowforge City
#      (Incendius), the Shadowforge Lock, the West Garrison (Angerforge), the Manufactory
#      (Argelmach), Jail Break! from Windsor's cell;
#   3. the same instance or a new one: the Grim Guzzler (Ribbly, Hurley, Phalanx), Flamelash, the
#      Seven, the Lyceum, Magmus, the Emperor (Moira kept alive).
# The Shadowforge Lock needed the key until patch 4.0.3a (warcraft.wiki.gg, East Garrison), and the
# game's own data keeps Forever on 1.x rules: so the second visit starts with the key.
#
# Prerequisites (Polestar's compiled guide, TrinityCore): Kharan Mighthammer (4341) after The
# Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan (3701, Group 29); Incendius! (4263) after Overmaster Pyron (4262);
# A Taste of Flame (4024) after 4023 (Group 25) or 4022; Dark Iron Legacy 3802 after 3801; The True
# Masters 4183 to 4224, Marshal Windsor (4241), Abandoned Hope (4242), A Crumpled Up Note (4264, an
# item that drops only once 4242 is handed in), A Shred of Hope (4282), Jail Break! (4322), one after
# the other from Dragonkin Menace (4182, Group 25, offered again here). Ribbly Screwspigot (4136) and
# Hurley Blackbreath (4126) need nothing: their errands (Yorba Screwspigot in Tanaris, Enohar
# Thunderbrew at Nethergarde Keep) are left out, as the compiler drops them.
# Left out: The Love Potion (Mistress Nagmara, in the Grim Guzzler: Gromsblood, the Azshara giants'
# Giant Silver Veins and a vial filled in Un'Goro), The Spectral Chalice (miners), Rocknot's Ale
# (only what opens the Bar Door), Attunement to the Core (raid), the level 58-60 dungeon set chains.
guide groupe-alliance/33-donjons-fin
title End of route · Dungeons 52-60 (optional)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 52-60
zone Western Plaguelands

step Blackrock Depths (dungeon, optional)
  label brd-start
  when group 4286
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Blackrock Depths: the Dark Iron dwarves' city under Blackrock Mountain, between the Searing Gorge and the Burning Steppes. Levels 52 to 60, bosses 51 to 59: easy for a group of 5 at 58 to 60; possible earlier at five (from about 54), difficult. The dungeon is huge: the guide splits it into three visits of one to two hours, with the quests given in Ironforge, Kharanos, the Burning Steppes, Lakeshire and Stormwind. Alone? Skip it.
  note Keep 12 free quest log slots. Most of these quests cannot be shared: each player takes their own.
  goto 42.9,85.0 "Chillwind Camp flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

step Ironforge: King Magni Bronzebeard
  when done brd-start
  zone Ironforge
  tip Magni stands in the High Seat, beside Royal Historian Archesonus, who took The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan in Group 29. Kharan is a prisoner in Blackrock Depths.
  accept 4341                         -- King Magni Bronzebeard

step Kharanos: Ragnar Thunderbrew
  when done brd-start
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Ride out of Ironforge down to Kharanos: Ragnar is in the Thunderbrew Distillery. His lost recipe is in the Grim Guzzler, the tavern of Blackrock Depths (third visit).
  accept 4126                         -- Ragnar Thunderbrew

step Fly to Morgan's Vigil
  when done brd-start
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Morgan's Vigil"
  zone Burning Steppes

step Morgan's Vigil
  when done brd-start
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Oralius, Jalinda Sprig, Helendis Riverhorn and Marshal Maxwell stand in the camp. Overmaster Pyron is outside the dungeon, on the way in; Incendius, inside, comes after him.
  accept 4286                         -- Oralius: the fanny packs drop all through the dungeon
  accept 4262                         -- Jalinda Sprig

step Morgan's Vigil: Helendis Riverhorn
  when done brd-start
  when turnedin 4182
  tip Helendis's chain (Dragonkin Menace done in Group 25) leads to Marshal Windsor, a prisoner in Blackrock Depths: first a round trip to Lakeshire and Stormwind, by flight.
  accept 4183                         -- Helendis Riverhorn

step Morgan's Vigil: Dragonkin Menace
  when done brd-start
  when !turnedin 4182
  tip Marshal Windsor's chain starts with Helendis's Dragonkin Menace (offered in Group 25): the black dragonkin of the hills east of Flame Crest and of the eastern edge of the Steppes, elite at around 52.
  accept 4182                         -- Helendis Riverhorn

step The black dragonkin
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4182
  tip Ride north-east from the Vigil into the hills: Broodlings, Dragonspawn and Wyrmkin in packs, the three Black Drakes apart, one in the northern hills and two further south.
  kill 7047 quest 4182                -- Black Broodling
  kill 7040 quest 4182                -- Black Dragonspawn
  kill 7041 quest 4182                -- Black Wyrmkin
  kill 7044 quest 4182                -- Black Drake

step Morgan's Vigil: Helendis Riverhorn
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4182
  turnin 4182                         -- Helendis Riverhorn
  accept 4183

step Fly to Lakeshire
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4183
  zone Burning Steppes
  goto 84.4,68.3 "Morgan's Vigil flight master"
  fly "Lakeshire"
  zone Redridge Mountains

step Lakeshire: Magistrate Solomon
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4183
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Solomon is in the town hall of Lakeshire.
  turnin 4183                         -- Magistrate Solomon
  accept 4184

step Fly to Stormwind
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4184
  zone Redridge Mountains
  goto 30.4,59.0 "Lakeshire flight master"
  fly "Stormwind"
  zone Stormwind City

step Stormwind Keep: Bolvar and Lady Prestor
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4184
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Highlord Bolvar Fordragon is in the throne room at the back of Stormwind Keep, Lady Katrana Prestor at his side: speak with her, then with him again.
  turnin 4184                         -- Highlord Bolvar Fordragon
  accept 4185
  kill 1749 quest 4185                -- Lady Katrana Prestor: speak with her
  turnin 4185                         -- Highlord Bolvar Fordragon
  accept 4186

step Fly to Lakeshire
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4186
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"
  fly "Lakeshire"
  zone Redridge Mountains

step Lakeshire: Magistrate Solomon
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4186
  zone Redridge Mountains
  turnin 4186                         -- Magistrate Solomon
  accept 4223

step Fly to Morgan's Vigil
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4223
  zone Redridge Mountains
  goto 30.4,59.0 "Lakeshire flight master"
  fly "Morgan's Vigil"
  zone Burning Steppes

step Morgan's Vigil: Marshal Maxwell
  when done brd-start
  when onquest 4223
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Maxwell sends you to Ragged John, at Flame Crest: the guide goes there next.
  turnin 4223                         -- Marshal Maxwell
  accept 4224

step Flame Crest
  when done brd-start
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Ride north along the road, then climb to the goblin camp on Flame Crest. Ragged John tells his story in the camp; Maxwort Uberglint and Yuka Screwspigot give one quest each for the dungeon.
  kill 9563 quest 4224                -- Ragged John: speak with him, to the end of his story
  accept 4123                         -- Maxwort Uberglint
  accept 4136                         -- Yuka Screwspigot

step Cyrus Therepentous: the Frenzied Black Drake
  when done brd-start
  when !turnedin 4023
  when !turnedin 4022
  tip A Taste of Flame, first part (offered in Group 25): Cyrus hides in a cave in the far east of the Steppes. The Frenzied Black Drake (elite 54) appears outside it and drops the molt.
  accept 4023                         -- Cyrus Therepentous
  collect 10575 quest 4023 @94.4,31.8 map 1428
  turnin 4023

step Cyrus Therepentous
  when done brd-start
  tip Cyrus hands over an Altered Black Dragonflight Molt with the quest: it goes on Bael'Gar's remains, in the dungeon (second visit).
  accept 4024                         -- Cyrus Therepentous

step Morgan's Vigil: Marshal Maxwell
  when done brd-start
  when complete 4224
  tip Ride back south to the Vigil: Maxwell now sends you after Marshal Windsor, in the dungeon's prison.
  turnin 4224                         -- Marshal Maxwell
  accept 4241

step Blackrock Mountain: Overmaster Pyron
  when done brd-start
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Ride west along the road, past Blackrock Stronghold, into Blackrock Mountain. Inside, cross the great chain to the hanging building in the middle (Forgewright's Tomb), go down through it, then down the next chain to the Grinding Quarry: Overmaster Pyron (elite 52) walks there. The dungeon's door is past the quarry, on the left, at the far end of the Masonry.
  goto 29.9,31.8 "Blackrock Mountain"
  kill 9026 quest 4262 @34.8,85.3 map 1427 -- Overmaster Pyron: the Grinding Quarry, before the dungeon's door

step Franclorn Forgewright (one player is enough)
  when done brd-start
  tip The Shadowforge Key opens the doors of the second and third visits (the Shadowforge Gates of the prison and the Shadowforge Lock): one key in the group is enough. Franclorn's ghost stands on his tomb in the hanging building, and only the dead see him. Whoever will carry the key: take off your gear (no repair bill), die in the lava under the chains, release, run back as a ghost from the graveyard and speak with Franclorn, then come back to life at your body or by a group mate's spell. To check in game.
  accept 3801 optional                -- Franclorn Forgewright, as a ghost
  turnin 3801 optional
  accept 3802 optional

step Blackrock Depths: along the way
  when done brd-start
  along until brd-end
  tip Collected all through the dungeon: the Dark Iron Fanny Packs, on the Anvilrage and Shadowforge dwarves (most of them carry one). The Relic Coffer Keys drop from the same dwarves, about one in eight, only for those on The Heart of the Mountain: 12 keys open the 12 doors of the Black Vault (first visit), whoever carries them.
  note Share The Good Stuff, The Heart of the Mountain and Hurley Blackbreath with your group: click each in the quest log, then Share. The others cannot be shared.
  collect 11468 quest 4286            -- Dark Iron Fanny Pack
  collect 11078 x12 optional          -- Relic Coffer Key

step Blackrock Depths, first visit: before going in
  when done brd-start
  tip First visit, no key needed: the Detention Block (the prison), the Ring of the Law, the Shrine of Thaurissan, the Black Vault and the Hall of Crafting. Bosses 51 to 56: 54 or more advised.
  note In the quest log: Kharan Mighthammer (King Magni), Marshal Windsor (Maxwell), The Good Stuff (Oralius), The Heart of the Mountain (Maxwort), Dark Iron Legacy (Franclorn, if taken). For the next visits: A Taste of Flame (Cyrus), Ribbly Screwspigot (Yuka), Hurley Blackbreath (Ragnar). Not on this route: Mistress Nagmara's quest in the tavern (its herbs and silver are gathered outside), the Spectral Chalice's (miners), Lothos Riftwaker's Attunement to the Core (raid).
  goto 34.8,85.3 map 1427 "Blackrock Depths" r 25

step Detention Block: Kharan and Windsor
  when done brd-start
  tip The Detention Block opens past the entrance. High Interrogator Gerstahn, in the southernmost room, drops the Prison Cell Key, which opens the cells (a rogue can pick them instead). Kharan Mighthammer and Marshal Windsor are locked in the cells of the south-east corridor: listen to Kharan's whole story; Windsor has given up, and his news goes back to Maxwell. Lord Roccor patrols the northern ring, Houndmaster Grebmar waits at its lowest point. To check in game: which cell holds whom.
  collect 11140 optional              -- Prison Cell Key: High Interrogator Gerstahn
  turnin 4341                         -- Kharan Mighthammer
  accept 4342
  kill 9021 quest 4342                -- Kharan Mighthammer: listen to his whole story
  turnin 4342
  accept 4361                         -- For King Magni
  turnin 4241                         -- Marshal Windsor
  accept 4242                         -- For Marshal Maxwell

step Ring of the Law and the Shrine of Thaurissan
  when done brd-start
  tip The open gate on the east side of the Detention Block leads into the Ring of the Law: the gate closes behind you, two waves of beasts come, then a random boss. Once it is down, a second gate opens into the East Garrison. From there, climb the stairs beside the arena gate and walk round the stands, close to the inner railing (the Arena Spectators come at you when you pass too near), to the Shrine of Thaurissan: Pyromancer Loregrain kneels before the Monument of Franclorn Forgewright.
  kill 9024 optional                  -- Pyromancer Loregrain

step The Domicile and the Black Vault
  when done brd-start
  tip From the Shrine, the bridge leads into the Domicile, then to the upper balcony of the Hall of Crafting, which opens on the Black Vault: Warder Stilgiss and Verek (elite 56 and 55). With 12 Relic Coffer Keys, open the 12 Relic Coffer doors; after the last one, the Warbringer Constructs wake, then Watchman Doomgrip comes. The Secret Safe under the Dark Coffer then holds the Heart of the Mountain. Fewer than 12 keys? Leave it: the guide does not come back to the vault.
  kill 9041 optional                  -- Warder Stilgiss
  collect 11309 quest 4123 optional   -- The Heart of the Mountain: the Secret Safe

step Hall of Crafting: Fineous Darkvire
  when done brd-start
  tip Fineous Darkvire (elite 54) walks up and down the winding ramp of the Hall of Crafting: clear the ramp first, interrupt his Holy Light. He drops Ironfel for every player on Dark Iron Legacy.
  collect 10999 quest 3802            -- Ironfel: Fineous Darkvire

step Shrine of Thaurissan: the monument
  label brd-v1-end
  when done brd-start
  tip Back up through the Domicile to the Shrine: place Ironfel on the Monument of Franclorn Forgewright. The Shadowforge Key is the reward. Then walk out the way you came: round the stands, through the Ring of the Law (its gates stay open) and the Detention Block.
  turnin 3802                         -- Monument of Franclorn Forgewright

step Flame Crest: Maxwort Uberglint
  when complete 4123
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Out of Blackrock Mountain on the Burning Steppes side, then north-east to Flame Crest.
  turnin 4123                         -- Maxwort Uberglint

step Morgan's Vigil: Marshal Maxwell
  when onquest 4242
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Ride back to Morgan's Vigil. Abandoned Hope: Maxwell takes the bad news; pick your reward. From now on, the Anvilrage dwarves of the Detention Block drop A Crumpled Up Note for you (second visit).
  turnin 4242                         -- Marshal Maxwell

step Morgan's Vigil: Jalinda Sprig
  when complete 4262
  zone Burning Steppes
  turnin 4262                         -- Jalinda Sprig
  accept 4263                         -- Lord Incendius, in the dungeon: second visit

step Morgan's Vigil: Oralius
  when complete 4286
  zone Burning Steppes
  turnin 4286                         -- Oralius

step Fly to Ironforge
  when onquest 4361
  zone Burning Steppes
  goto 84.4,68.3 "Morgan's Vigil flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

step Ironforge: King Magni Bronzebeard
  when onquest 4361
  zone Ironforge
  tip The Bearer of Bad News: Magni then asks you to save Princess Moira, the Emperor's prisoner at the bottom of the dungeon (third visit).
  turnin 4361                         -- King Magni Bronzebeard
  accept 4362

step Fly to Thorium Point
  when onquest 4362
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Thorium Point"
  zone Searing Gorge

step Blackrock Depths, second visit: before going in
  when done brd-start
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Second visit, with the Shadowforge Key: Windsor's note, the Dark Iron Highway (Bael'Gar), Shadowforge City (Incendius), the West Garrison (Angerforge), the Manufactory (Argelmach), then Jail Break! from Windsor's cell. Bosses 52 to 57: 56 or more advised. From Thorium Point, ride south across the Searing Gorge into Blackrock Mountain.
  note In the quest log: A Taste of Flame (Cyrus), Incendius! (Jalinda Sprig). Keep one free quest log slot for Jail Break!. For the third visit: The Fate of the Kingdom (Magni), Ribbly Screwspigot, Hurley Blackbreath.
  goto 34.8,85.3 map 1427 "Blackrock Depths" r 25

step Detention Block: A Crumpled Up Note
  when done brd-start
  when turnedin 4242
  tip The Anvilrage dwarves of the Detention Block drop A Crumpled Up Note (about one in four) to those who handed in Abandoned Hope: right-click it. Kill Gerstahn again for the Prison Cell Key and bring the note to Windsor.
  accept 4264                         -- A Crumpled Up Note: Anvilrage dwarves
  turnin 4264                         -- Marshal Windsor
  accept 4282

step Dark Iron Highway: Bael'Gar
  when done brd-start
  tip The Shadowforge Gate on the north side of the Detention Block opens with the key onto the Dark Iron Highway: large packs of dwarves. Bael'Gar (elite 54) stands at its west end; once he is down, use the Altered Black Dragonflight Molt on his remains.
  collect 11230 quest 4024            -- Encased Fiery Essence: the molt on Bael'Gar's remains

step Shadowforge City: Lord Incendius
  when done brd-start
  tip The great doors at the east end of the Highway open on Shadowforge City, above a lava lake. Lord Incendius (elite 55) guards the Black Anvil on the central bridge: tank him in the middle, his Mighty Blow knocks you into the lava, with no way back up.
  kill 9017 quest 4263                -- Lord Incendius

step West Garrison and the Manufactory
  when done brd-start
  tip Back along the Highway to the Detention Block, then through the East Garrison Door (the key) into the East Garrison. Go down the stairs to the Shadowforge Lock, the great wheel, and open it with the key: the giant door over the Highway turns, and its passage leads across to the West Garrison. Down the left-hand stairs: General Angerforge (elite 57, calls adds at low health). Down the right-hand stairs, across the Manufactory: Golem Lord Argelmach and his two golems (kill the golems first). Each drops part of Marshal Windsor's Lost Information.
  collect 11464 quest 4282            -- Marshal Windsor's Lost Information: General Angerforge
  collect 11465 quest 4282            -- Marshal Windsor's Lost Information: Golem Lord Argelmach

step Detention Block: Jail Break!
  label brd-v2-end
  when done brd-start
  tip Back to Windsor's cell. Everyone hands in A Shred of Hope before anyone starts Jail Break!, with a free quest log slot. Windsor gets his gear back in the supply room clockwise from his cell, then frees his friends from the cells of the corridor round the Ring of the Law: open each cell when he asks, not before. Stay near him; he must not die. At the end he runs to the entrance and the quest is done. Failed? Abandon it, leave and reset the dungeon, then try again.
  turnin 4282                         -- Marshal Windsor
  accept 4322
  complete 4322                       -- Escort Marshal Windsor

step Blackrock Depths, third visit: the Grim Guzzler
  when done brd-start
  tip Third visit: the bottom of the dungeon, bosses 55 to 59, 58 or more advised. With the time, go on in the same run; or come back later: through the East Garrison Door, the Shadowforge Lock and the West Garrison again. Past Argelmach, the bridge leads to the Grim Guzzler: its patrons are neutral, so no area spells. Ribbly Screwspigot is friendly until threatened (his talk option): he fights with his cronies. Smash the three Thunderbrew Lager Kegs of the storage room near him: Hurley Blackbreath comes with his cronies. To open the Bar Door, buy Dark Iron Ale Mugs from Plugger Spazzring and give them to Private Rocknot until he loses his temper: Phalanx then breaks the door and attacks.
  collect 11313 quest 4136            -- Ribbly's Head: Ribbly Screwspigot
  collect 11312 quest 4126            -- Lost Thunderbrew Recipe: Hurley Blackbreath

step Ambassador Flamelash and the Seven
  when done brd-start
  tip Through the Bar Door, left into the Chamber of Enchantment: Ambassador Flamelash (elite 57) calls adds from the corners, kill them before they reach him. Then the Mold Foundry and the Summoners' Tomb: speak with Doom'rel to start the Seven, who come one after the other; the door opens after the last. To the right on the way out: the Molten Bridge and the Molten Core's portal (raid).
  kill 9156 optional                  -- Ambassador Flamelash

step The Lyceum and Magmus
  when done brd-start
  tip In the Lyceum, the Shadowforge Flame Keepers (red armour) drop two Shadowforge Torches: light the two braziers at the back, the doors open on the Iron Hall. Magmus (elite 57) waits at the far end: keep out of the fire jets of the side alcoves.
  kill 9938 optional                  -- Magmus

step The Imperial Seat: Emperor Dagran Thaurissan
  label brd-v3-end
  when done brd-start
  tip Emperor Dagran Thaurissan (elite 59) and Princess Moira Bronzebeard. The Fate of the Kingdom: kill the Emperor WITHOUT killing Moira, who heals him: one player keeps her busy and interrupts her, everyone else on the Emperor. She then stops fighting: speak with her.
  kill 9019 quest 4362                -- Emperor Dagran Thaurissan
  turnin 4362                         -- Princess Moira Bronzebeard
  accept 4363

step Flame Crest: Yuka Screwspigot
  when complete 4136
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Out of the dungeon (the way back or your hearthstone), then out of Blackrock Mountain on the Burning Steppes side, north-east to Flame Crest.
  turnin 4136                         -- Yuka Screwspigot

step Cyrus Therepentous
  when complete 4024
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip East along the hills to Cyrus's cave.
  turnin 4024                         -- Cyrus Therepentous

step Morgan's Vigil: Marshal Maxwell
  when complete 4322
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Ride back south to Morgan's Vigil. Maxwell's next quest, Stormwind Rendezvous, starts the long chain to Onyxia's Lair, through Upper Blackrock Spire: not in this guide.
  turnin 4322                         -- Marshal Maxwell

