  when complete 4126
  zone Dun Morogh
  turnin 4126                         -- Ragnar Thunderbrew

step Blackrock Depths: quests not done
  label brd-end
  when done brd-start
  tip What is left of Blackrock Depths in the quest log is for another run: keep it for one, or drop it to free the log.
  abandon 4123 optional
  abandon 4282 optional
  abandon 4322 optional
  abandon 4362 optional
  abandon 4263 optional
